@page "/components/echarts"
@using Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts.Components
@using Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts.Models

<PageTitle>ECharts — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">ECharts</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Apache ECharts for Blazor static SSR + Unpoly, <em>separated from the core</em> so the core ships no charting JS.
    30 chart components — Lumeo parity — from Bar to Word Cloud. The server renders a <code>&lt;div data-echarts&gt;</code> with <code>data-options</code> JSON; the compiler in
    <code>_content/Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts/echarts.js</code> creates, resizes and disposes the instance on every fragment swap.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    Core <a href="/components/chart"><code>Chart</code></a> stays container-only (CSS variables + table fallback). Reach for
    <code>EChart</code> when you need axes, zoom, or a line through irregular time. Install the separate package
    <code>Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts</code> to opt in.
</p>

<div class="mt-4 rounded-md border bg-muted/30 p-4 text-sm">
    <p class="font-medium">Wiring a head</p>
    <pre class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto text-xs"><code>@@* App.razor *@@
&lt;script src="_content/Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts/echarts/echarts.min.js" defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="_content/Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts/echarts.js" defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;

@@* app.css *@@
@@source "../../Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts/Components/**/*.razor";
@@source "../../Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn.ECharts/wwwroot/echarts.js";</code></pre>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
        Colors default to <code>--chart-1..5</code> so a theme change moves the chart without re-serializing.
        Override with <code>Colors</code> or <code>OptionOverride</code>. Tooltip is no longer clipped — container is <code>overflow-visible</code> (fixed hover hidden).
    </p>
</div>

